nduct research to increase your production power.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up new production lines for the ever-changing market. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ahead of the market by being the first to research new types of drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your workers and managers, and outshine your competitors with the best teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spy on, sabotage, take over your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over and disrupt your competitors' customer networks and control the market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635720/extras/3f2344ab785aa8825e1598ffcbd29694.poster.avif?t=1753912873\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635720/extras/3f2344ab785aa8825e1598ffcbd29694.webm?t=1753912873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635720/extras/3f2344ab785aa8825e1598ffcbd29694.mp4?t=1753912873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Gameplay, Never Without Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to set things right at the factory over a hot cup of coffee? This game is cozy but the competition is fierce! Manage time, resources, production and workers, satisfy your customers, destroy your competitors and maintain your hard earned success at the market! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
